WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.104 --> 00:00:01.748
- I've always said that, whatever I put

00:00:01.748 --> 00:00:02.790
in my mouth is my business.

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:03.849
(laughter)

00:00:03.849 --> 00:00:06.266
(easy music)

00:00:07.721 --> 00:00:09.256
- Hello, my name is Scot Jones

00:00:09.256 --> 00:00:11.718
and I am the Executive
Chef at Crossroads Kitchen

00:00:11.718 --> 00:00:13.173
Los Angeles, California.

00:00:13.173 --> 00:00:14.799
I started the plant-based restaurant with

00:00:14.799 --> 00:00:16.191
Chrissy Hein in Akron, Ohio

00:00:16.191 --> 00:00:18.717
called the Vegeteranian.

00:00:18.717 --> 00:00:21.641
And that's when I got into

00:00:21.641 --> 00:00:23.332
the plant-based cooking world.

00:00:23.332 --> 00:00:25.842
Today they're trying
the Impossible Burger,

00:00:25.842 --> 00:00:26.870
Chicken and Waffles,

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:29.534
the Crispy Chicken Milanese Sandwich,

00:00:29.534 --> 00:00:31.797
and our Kale Caesar.

00:00:31.797 --> 00:00:34.797
(upbeat jazz music)

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:36.751
- Oh I am so excited.

00:00:36.751 --> 00:00:37.668
- This is so exciting.

00:00:37.668 --> 00:00:39.273
(upbeat jazz music)

00:00:39.273 --> 00:00:41.118
- Tastes like a burger, very good.

00:00:41.118 --> 00:00:43.003
- It literally just
looks like ground beef.

00:00:43.003 --> 00:00:45.058
- My love for cheeseburgers
is well documented

00:00:45.058 --> 00:00:49.215
and I would eat these endlessly.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.798
(upbeat music)

00:00:53.162 --> 00:00:54.315
- It's a really good salad.

00:00:54.315 --> 00:00:55.170
- It's really good.

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:56.720
- Kale, especially when
it's raw like this,

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:58.694
is hard to make taste good,

00:00:58.694 --> 00:01:00.184
but this tastes really good.

00:01:00.184 --> 00:01:01.017
- Yeah I would have no idea

00:01:01.017 --> 00:01:02.315
there was no dairy in that dressing.

00:01:02.315 --> 00:01:03.385
I could eat this every day

00:01:03.385 --> 00:01:04.950
for the rest of my life I feel like.

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:07.533
(casual music)

00:01:09.032 --> 00:01:11.766
(groaning)

00:01:11.766 --> 00:01:12.765
(laughter)

00:01:12.765 --> 00:01:14.401
- (inaudible) It just tastes
like a chicken sandwich.

00:01:14.401 --> 00:01:15.694
Like my family's from Argentina,

00:01:15.694 --> 00:01:18.077
we make Milanesas, it tastes like that.

00:01:18.077 --> 00:01:20.510
- It reminds me of going to a deli

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:22.571
and just getting a nice
fresh sandwich from there.

00:01:22.571 --> 00:01:25.470
- As someone who loves
chicken even specifically,

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:26.778
like I eat tons of chicken.

00:01:26.778 --> 00:01:27.611
This is delicious.

00:01:27.611 --> 00:01:30.194
(upbeat music)

00:01:32.753 --> 00:01:33.619
- Mm

00:01:33.619 --> 00:01:34.452
- Right?

00:01:34.452 --> 00:01:36.051
- Mm. Mm.

00:01:36.051 --> 00:01:38.301
- I would gladly eat this
every day of my life.

00:01:38.301 --> 00:01:42.956
Question, so what's
different about the waffle?

00:01:42.956 --> 00:01:44.389
- [Chef] Applesauce

00:01:44.389 --> 00:01:45.222
- [Together] What?

00:01:45.222 --> 00:01:46.410
- That sounds better anyway.

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:49.164
So you can just straight up
use applesauce instead of eggs

00:01:49.164 --> 00:01:51.476
and why doesn't everyone do that?

00:01:51.476 --> 00:01:53.209
- It's so much more fluffier too.

00:01:53.209 --> 00:01:54.818
- Oh my god what's that over there?

00:01:54.818 --> 00:01:57.068
(laughter)

00:01:59.116 --> 00:02:00.017
So crazy how that worked out.

00:02:00.017 --> 00:02:00.958
- Oh my god.

00:02:00.958 --> 00:02:02.410
You killed that.

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:03.727
- Oh I can keep going.

00:02:03.727 --> 00:02:06.164
More waffles please.

00:02:06.164 --> 00:02:07.151
Waffle me.

00:02:07.151 --> 00:02:07.984
- Chop chop.

00:02:07.984 --> 00:02:09.434
- I just feel like you
could describe Crossroads as

00:02:09.434 --> 00:02:10.964
good food with compassion.

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:12.224
- I'm just gonna say it I'm sorry,

00:02:12.224 --> 00:02:14.734
I would eat this over
Rosco's chicken and waffles

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:15.993
in a heartbeat.

00:02:15.993 --> 00:02:16.899
- I feel like when people say

00:02:16.899 --> 00:02:18.657
oh I'm a vegetarian or vegan or whatever,

00:02:18.657 --> 00:02:21.615
you think they just eat rice
and beans all day, or bananas.

00:02:21.615 --> 00:02:23.538
Look at all this.

00:02:23.538 --> 00:02:24.526
It could be more.

00:02:24.526 --> 00:02:27.109
(casual music)

00:02:36.787 --> 00:02:38.101
(hinges squeaking)

